{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":15,"ref":"2-chronicles 32:15","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"su","chapter":32,"translation":"Ayeuna ulah Hizkia mikadoké aranjeun, jeung ulah manéhna ngagoda aranjeun kawas kieu; ulah aranjeun percaya ka manéhna, sabab moal sanggup Eloah mana waé, ti bangsa jeung karajaan mana waé, ngabébaskeun bangsana tina leungeun kula jeung tina leungeun bapa-bapa kula — leuwih-lami mah, moal elohim aranjeun ngabébaskeun aranjeun tina leungeun kula!","tokens":[{"surface":"ועתה","gloss":"ayeuna"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"ulah"},{"surface":"ישיא","gloss":"mikadoké"},{"surface":"אתכם","gloss":"⟨את⟩ aranjeun"},{"surface":"חזקיהו","gloss":"Hizkia"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"jeung ulah"},{"surface":"יסית","gloss":"ngagoda"},{"surface":"אתכם","gloss":"⟨את⟩ aranjeun"},{"surface":"כזאת","gloss":"kawas kieu"},{"surface":"ואל","gloss":"jeung ulah"},{"surface":"תאמינו","gloss":"percaya aranjeun"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"ka manéhna"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sabab"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"moal"},{"surface":"יוכל","gloss":"sanggup"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"mana waé"},{"surface":"אלוה","gloss":"Eloah"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"sakabéh"},{"surface":"גוי","gloss":"bangsa"},{"surface":"וממלכה","gloss":"jeung karajaan"},{"surface":"להציל","gloss":"ngabébaskeun"},{"surface":"עמו","gloss":"bangsana"},{"surface":"מידי","gloss":"tina leungeun kula"},{"surface":"ומיד","gloss":"jeung tina leungeun"},{"surface":"אבותי","gloss":"bapa-bapa kula"},{"surface":"אף","gloss":"leuwih-lami"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"moal"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"elohim aranjeun"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"moal"},{"surface":"יצילו","gloss":"ngabébaskeun"},{"surface":"אתכם","gloss":"⟨את⟩ aranjeun"},{"surface":"מידי","gloss":"tina leungeun kula"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-26T16:32:18.391360739Z","model":"glm-5.3"}